cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Mamba-based short-term traffic forecasting with a spatial-information ablation"
abstract: >-
  Engineering implementation of an M.Sc./B.Sc. thesis experiment on short-term
  traffic flow forecasting. Contains the Mamba backbone built on the official
  mamba_ssm selective-scan kernel, the baseline models (Persistence, Historical
  average, LSTM, Transformer, Graph WaveNet, DCRNN), the input-side three-arm
  ablation, and the raw result files from which the paper's tables are generated.
type: software
authors:
